. Apply for this job As a research assistant, you will have the opportunity to participate in all aspects of the research process (on topics covering industrial organization, digital economies, financial markets and banking) including literature search and review, theoretical analysis, model simulation, data collection, and research design. Requirements: BS/Ba in Economics. Master in Economics or Finance and policy interest valued. Knowledge in LaTex/Scientific Word, Matlab, R, Python, Mathematica, Stata valued Work-permit in Spain High level command of English and excellent writing skills in English and Spanish (Catalan valued) Students finalizing a BS/Ba in Economics with strong record or a Master Degree are welcome Students envisaging to pursue an Economic or Business PhD are also welcome Conditions: Full-time position 1.830€ month before tax Department Research Assistants Locations Barcelona, Spain Remote status Hybrid Employment type Full-time Apply for this job Research Assistants · Barcelona, Spain · Hybrid Research Assistant to Prof. Xavier Vives Join Prof. Xavier Vives' team as a Research Assistant: contribute to cutting-edge economics research (IO, digital economies, finance), develop data, modeling, and policy skills... Loading application form Close modal Career site Data & privacy Manage cookies iese.edu/ LinkedIn Instagram Employee login Candidate Connect login Already working at IESE Business School? Let’s recruit together and find your next colleague. Log in Applicant tracking system by Teamtailor"
